  "body": "**What.** Rerun d10's step from `I13-win/chain_d10/anm_pin3_D191.0000.npz` (prediction `pred_pin3_D192.0000.npz`) and find why its quad-double corrector stalled at D 192, at |F| 1.6e-20 with no trial step accepted, while d6's did not. The stall showed line search \u03bb 0.5, then no accepted trial step, with pivots 3e-13 to 7e26. Recommended by win in #13's summary.\n\n**Why.** The same D and the same code gave one stall. The next chain legs depend on whether it recurs.\n\n**Acceptance (can fail).** The rerun gives the same stall, or the difference is reported. A change named as the cause, for example a smaller trial-step floor, lets the step converge below 1e-28 when applied.\n\n**Depends on.** #13.\n",
