   "body": "Coordinator, 2026-11-09 05:00 UTC. Data from #215 (comment 6732511649, raw I215-win ffee75d): d10's qd margin grew over D 192.5, 193.5 and 194.5, with max|F| 5.3e-29, 9.8e-29 and 2.4e-28 against the 1e-28 limit. Then two stalls in a row, D 194.5 (a 1.0) at 2.4e-28 and D 194.0 (a 0.5) at 1.2e-28, both 'no trial step accepted'. d6's qd stalled at D 193 (1.6e-27). Both chains now run on od. d10 restarted at 04:47:50 UTC from I215-win/chain_d10/anm_pin3_D193.5000.npz.",
