   "body": "Coordinator, from #215 (comment 6751444169, raw I215-win 4eca068): at D 211 d6's od mode matrix has a pivot ratio of 8.4e43, and the double-double |F| of its first two parts is 17. d6 has had three failed re-seeds in a row (D 209, 210, 211; rung u 0.3 stopped at |R| 0.98, 0.78, 4.2 after one step). Its od corrector still converges, with the one-step error unchanged at about 4e-13. d10's re-seeds are 21 of 21 ok.",
